 ></iframe></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bf5b988 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bf5b988" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-weight: 700;">Contactgegevens Carte Blanche:</span></div><p><span style="color: #000000;">Stuur een e-mail naar <span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="mailto:info@carteblanche.nu">informatie@carteblanche.nu&nbsp;</a></span></span><br><span style="color: #000000;">Onze contacturen zijn: maandag t/m donderdag van 09:30 tot 17:00. Telefoonnummer:&nbsp;<span style="background-color: #ffffff;">040 2451739</span></span></p><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Adres gegevens&nbsp;Carte Blanche:</b></span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;">Daalakkersweg 10-08</span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;">5641 JA Eindhoven</span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;">Kvk 41039437</span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;">BTW NL006298059B01</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8baae53 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="8baae53" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23b07f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="23b07f9" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7362425 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7362425" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Vakanties seizoen 2026/2027</h1></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e360a8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="e360a8a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-312ebb6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="312ebb6" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ac20481 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="ac20481" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2b80c87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2b80c87" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img decoding="async" src="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/HKXH7238-scaled-rpq869xra6co6ml2qyhyt8s62vxgqawr9lzohtv6hs.jpg" title="HKXH7238" alt="HKXH7238" loading="lazy" /></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52d6cc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="52d6cc0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><ul><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Herfstvakantie: 17 oktober t/m 25 oktober </b>*m.u.v. De Dutch Designweek (DDW)</span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Kerstvakantie: 19 december t/m 3 januari</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Voorjaarsvakantie: 6 februari t/m 14 februari</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Tweede Paasdag: maandag 29 april</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Meivakantie: 24 april t/m 2 mei</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Hemelvaartsdag: donderdag 6 mei</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Tweede Pinksterdag: maandag 17 mei</b></span></li><li><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Zomervakantie: 24 juli t/m 5 september</b></span></li></ul><div><span style="color: #000000;"><b> </b></span><br /><span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;">Beeld: (puin)hoop</span><br /><span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;">Fotografie: Harry Kleijnen</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0702032 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="0702032" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-08d78a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="08d78a0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7b958c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7b958c4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">ANBI</h1></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-22bf017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="22bf017" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8a608e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8a608e8" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div><span style="color: #000000;">Stichting Carte Blanche beschikt over een ANBI status. </span>Een ANBI is een algemeen nut beogende instelling. Een instelling kan alleen ANBI zijn als ze zich voor minstens 90% inzet voor het algemeen nut. Met het oog op het behoud van de ANBI status is Carte Blanche verplicht diverse gegevens openbaar te maken. Hier treft u deze gegevens.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-023c571 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="023c571" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-40ea17c e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="40ea17c" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8057fa3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8057fa3" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div><b>Statuten &amp; beleidsplan</b></div><div><ul style="background: #ffffff;"><li style="padding: 10px 0px 0px;"><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/CB-statuten-geheel-2.pdf">statuten</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Carte-Blanche-2021-2024.pdf">beleidsplan 2021-2024</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/anbi-format-640-org-zonder-winststr-ib1101z1fol-1.pdf">Anbi format</a></span></li></ul><p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-4323 alignleft" src="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ANBI-logo-4x3-1.png" alt="" width="272" height="204" srcset="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ANBI-logo-4x3-1.png 736w, https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ANBI-logo-4x3-1-300x225.png 300w, https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ANBI-logo-4x3-1-580x435.png 580w" sizes="(max-width: 272px) 100vw, 272px" /></p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fe6f118 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="fe6f118" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div><b>Jaarverslagen</b></div><ul><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Jaarverslag-2021.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jaarverslag 2021</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/jaarverslag-2022-230322.pdf">jaarverslag 2022</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/240429-CB-2023-jaarverslag-activiteiten.pdf">jaarverslag 2023</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><i><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/250422-CB-2024-jaarverslag-activiteiten-incl-financiele-paragraaf.pdf">jaarverslag 2024</a><br /></i></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><i><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/260429-CB-2025-jaarverslag-activiteiten.pdf">jaarverslag 2025</a></i></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/CB-jaarrekening-2021.pdf">financieel verslag 2021</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/CB-jaarrekening-2022.pdf">financieel verslag 2022</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/240606-CB-jaarrekening-2023.pdf">financieel verslag 2023</a></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CB-jaarrekening-2024-incl-getekend-bestuursverslag.pdf">financieel verslag 2024</a><br /></span></li><li><span style="color: #e3b247;"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/260429-CB-jaarrekening-2025-incl-getekend-bestuursverslag.pdf">financieel verslag 2025</a></span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a0f957e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="a0f957e" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9ecd0c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="9ecd0c3" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ecab8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1ecab8b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Donaties</h1></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5a0bb40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="5a0bb40" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b0a408f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b0a408f" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><p>Help onze kunstenaars groeien. Bij Carte Blanche vormen beperkingen geen obstakel, maar de motor van onze kunst. Onze spelers en makers, met en zonder beperkingen, maken vanuit hun eigen kracht, verbeelding en perspectief. Wil je bijdragen aan hun ontwikkeling? Met jouw steun kunnen onze kunstenaars zichzelf blijven uitdagen, nieuwe mogelijkheden ontdekken en zich verder ontwikkelen in hun kunstenaarschap. <b>Dankjewel dat je Carte Blanche wilt ondersteunen!</b></p><p>Je kunt je donatie overmaken naar het bankrekeningnummer onderaan deze pagina. Wil je liever eerst contact met ons opnemen of meer weten? Stuur ons dan gerust een e-mail of bel ons. <b>Vermeld bij je donatie graag je naam en in de omschrijving dat het om een donatie gaat.</b></p></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ff60990 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="ff60990" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bbda385 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="bbda385" data-element_type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e4bc996 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e4bc996" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;"><b>Bank gegevens&nbsp;Carte Blanche:</b></span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><p>NAAM: Stichting Carte Blanche<br>REKENING: NL38 ABNA 0418 3061 68<br>BIC: ABNANL2A<br><br>KVK: 41039437<br>BTW: NL006298059B01</p><p></p><div style="background: #ffffff;"><div><span>Stuur een </span><b>e-mail </b><span>naar </span><span style="color: rgb(227, 178, 71);"><a style="color: #e3b247;" href="mailto:info@carteblanche.nu">informatie@carteblanche.nu&nbsp;</a></span></div><div><span style="background-color: #ffffff;"><b>Telefoonnummer</b>: </span><span style="background: #ffffff;">040 2451739</span><br>Onze contacturen zijn: maandag t/m donderdag van 09:30 tot 17:00.</div></div><div><span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;"><br>Beeld: Ongeveer 1984</span><br><span style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;">Fotografie: Harry Kleijnen</span></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b448f50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="b448f50" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"> <img decoding="async" src="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/HKXH1078-scaled-e1787843677110-rsj12viiodhf09tqekqna1kpqn1kww17ojj7f1qwf4.jpg" title="HKXH1078" alt="HKXH1078" loading="lazy" /></div></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-57875c3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="57875c3" data-element_type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-87de75a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="87de75a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="elementor-spacer"><div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cl"></div></div></div></div></div> <a href="javascript:void(0)" id="slide_top" class="cmsmasters_theme_icon_slide_top"><span></span></a></div><footer id="footer" class="cmsmasters_color_scheme_footer cmsmasters_footer_default"><div class="footer_inner"><div class="footer_in_inner"><div class="social_wrap"><div class="social_wrap_inner"><ul><li> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/carteblanchetheater/" class="cmsmasters_social_icon cmsmasters_social_icon_1 cmsmasters-icon-facebook" title="Facebook" target="_blank"></a></li><li> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/stichtingcarteblanche/" class="cmsmasters_social_icon cmsmasters_social_icon_2 cmsmasters-icon-custom-instagram" title="Instagram" target="_blank"></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="footer_logo_wrap"><a href="https://carteblanche.nu/" title="Carte Blanche" class="footer_logo"> <img src="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Logo-Carte-Blanche-2018-wit-klein.png" alt="Carte Blanche" /> <img class="footer_logo_retina" src="https://carteblanche.nu/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Logo-Carte-Blanche-2018-wit-klein.png" alt="Carte Blanche" width="30" height="30" /> </a></div><div class="footer_nav_wrap"><nav><div class="menu-footer-menu-container"><ul id="footer_nav" class="footer_nav"><li id="menu-item-370" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-370"><a h